# Testing

- Calculator logic in `src/lib/calculator.ts` must stay pure and covered by Vitest in `tests/unit/`.
- New interactive behavior (forms, calculator UI, language switcher, nav) needs a unit and/or Playwright test — prefer behavior over implementation details.
- Pure content page copy does not need dedicated tests; navigation/i18n e2e covers reachability.
- Before finishing interactive work: `npm run test`. For nav/i18n/calculator/contact: also `npm run test:e2e`.
